      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"To believe we must staunch our support for global need is to prioritize political slogans over human dignity, a truly myopic view of progress.  Sating all domestic wants in the face of widespread global suffering is not responsible fiscal policy, but a moral failure that deepens global instability.  A strong, secure nation is one that is not only strong at home but is also a responsible global citizen, capable of supporting the world from which it ultimately benefits.",
      "source": "target",
